<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka Jan-April rubber output 36.4 mln kg.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka Jan-April rubber output 36.4 mln kg.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's January-April 1997 rubber output fell 5.7 percent to 36.4 million kg from 38.6 million kg in the same period last year, the Central Bank said in its latest economic report on Friday.</p>
<p>Rubber production in the first three months was down 4.5 percent at 27.9 million kg against the same period last year.</p>
</text>
